  "title": "Dad&#39;s Leftover Turkey Pot Pie",
  "description": "Dad&#39;s leftover turkey pot pie recipe, made with leftover turkey and frozen veggies, is baked in pie crusts for the perfect post-holiday comfort food.",
  "authors": [
    "Rob Neil"
  ],
  "date_published": "2007-11-25T16:40:50-05:00",
